checkDegrees(...,Strict=>...) -- forces strict equality of degrees
******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        d = checkDegrees(N, M, Strict =>true)

Description
===========

Used with Strict=>false, the default, checkDegrees(N,M) returns (true, deg) if
degrees M and degrees N are equal up to a shift d. With Strict => true the
degree lists must be equal.

